#: dbushandler.cpp:96
msgid ""
"The Web share for magnet-links is disabled. You can set it up at settings:/"
"network-and-connectivity/sharing"
msgstr ""
"A compartición web para ligazóns magnet está desactivada. Pode activala "
"desde «settings:/network-and-connectivity/sharing»."

#: dbushandler.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Cannot start process for KTorrent.                           This should not "
"happen, even if KTorrent is not installed.                           Check "
"your machines resources and limits."
msgstr ""
"Non é posíbel iniciar o proceso de KTorrent. Isto non debería pasar, nin "
"sequera cando KTorrent non está instalado. Comprobe os recursos e límites do "
"seu computador."

#: dbushandler.cpp:158
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not connect to KTorrent via DBus                                     "
"after %1 seconds. Is it broken?"
msgstr ""
"Non se puido conectar con KTorrent mediante DBus, van %1 segundos sen "
"resposta. Estragouse?"

#: dbushandler.cpp:180
msgid ""
"Could not get the group list, do you have a compatible KTorrent version "
"running?"
msgstr ""
"Non se puido obter a lista de grupos, está a executar unha versión de "
"KTorrent compatíbel?"

#: dbushandler.cpp:333
#, kde-format
msgid "The link for %1 does not contain the required btih hash-parameter."
msgstr "Á ligazón de «%1» fáltalle o parámetro BTIH necesario."

#: dbushandler.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgid "The found value (%1) for the hash is neither 32 nor 40 chars long."
msgstr "O valor atopado para o hash (%1) non ten nin 32 nin 40 caracteres."

#: dbushandler.cpp:624
msgid "Torrent has been removed from KTorrent."
msgstr "Retirouse o torrent de KTorrent."

#: kio_magnet.cpp:294 kio_magnet.cpp:395
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"File exists in KTorrent, but cannot open it on disk at path\"%1\". Have you "
"removed the file manually?"
msgstr ""
"O ficheiro existe en KTorrent, pero non se pode abrir na ruta «%1». Eliminou "
"o ficheiro manualmente?"

#: kio_magnet.cpp:375
msgid "You cannot write to magnet resources."
msgstr "Non pode escribir sobre recursos magnet."

#: kio_magnet.cpp:403
#, kde-format
msgid "File \"%1\" is a directory. This should not happen. Please file a bug."
msgstr ""
"A ruta «%1» corresponde a un directorio. Isto non é normal, debería informar "
"do erro."

#: kio_magnet.cpp:429
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"File exists in KTorrent, but cannot open it on disk at path \"%1\". Have you "
"removed the file manually?"
msgstr ""
"O ficheiro existe en KTorrent, pero non se pode abrir na ruta «%1». Eliminou "
"o ficheiro manualmente?"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Enabled), group (Magnet)
#: magnetsettings.kcfg:10
msgid "Enable the global magnet-link support."
msgstr "Activar a compatibilidade global con ligazóns magnet."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShareSize), group (Magnet)
#: magnetsettings.kcfg:14
msgid "Total maximum size used by the share in MiB."
msgstr "Tamaño máximo total empregado pola compartición, en MiB."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (TrustedHosts), group (Magnet)
#: magnetsettings.kcfg:18
msgid "List of hosts which are directly accepted on loading"
msgstr "Lista de servidores que aceptar directamente ao cargar."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ManagedTorrents), group (Magnet)
#: magnetsettings.kcfg:21
msgid "Torrents inside KTorrent which are managed by these modules."
msgstr "Torrentes dentro de KTorrent xestionados por estes módulos."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RunningTorrents), group (Magnet)
#: magnetsettings.kcfg:24
msgid "Torrents currently used by the I/O-Slaves."
msgstr ""
"Torrentes empregados nestes momentos polos escravos de lectura e escritura."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MaxShareRatio), group (Magnet)
#: magnetsettings.kcfg:27
msgid "The maximum share ratio which should be targeted for each torrent."
msgstr ""
"A taxa de compartición máxima á que se debería intentar chegar en cada "
"torrente."
